# Waypoint Memory Protocol

Full contract: `AGENTS.md` at repo root. Non-negotiables:

## Session start

- Read `vault/00-START-HERE.md`, the newest note in `vault/03-Sessions/`, and `research/00-PROGRESS.md` before doing anything else.
- Never re-read the whole repo. Question about project content or structure? Query the graph first: `graphify query "<question>" --budget 2000` (uses `graphify-out/graph.json`). Interactive UI: `graph/index.html`.

## During work

- Record decisions immediately in `vault/02-Decisions/` (template in `vault/_templates/`, update `_Decision-Log.md`).
- Versioned artifacts carry `Version-Timestamp: YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss TZ` (vault notes: `updated:` frontmatter).
- Claudio reviews research via `dashboard/index.html` (dashboard-first), not raw markdown walls.

## Session end (mandatory)

1. Session note in `vault/03-Sessions/`.
2. Update `vault/00-START-HERE.md` and `research/00-PROGRESS.md` (they must agree).
3. Docs changed? Rebuild graph via graphify `--update`.
4. Commit (Conventional Commits + attribution footer per `AGENTS.md`) and push to GitHub.

## Versioning

- `main` = latest approved version. Short-lived `feat/`, `fix/`, `docs/` branches. Milestones: semver tag + `CHANGELOG.md` entry. See `docs/VERSIONING.md`.
